<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21324" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμ-ίσκος</span></b> , ὁ, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>altar-shaped vessel</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				1.38
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bandage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).823
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Arith.,
				<i>solid</i> or <i>solid number</i> with all its dimensions
			unequal bounded by rectangles and trapezia, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
			</span></i>
			<i>*Deff.</i><i><span class="en">
				114
			</span></i>, Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.41
			</span></i> H., <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Ar.</u>
				2.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Syrian.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				143.7
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> Geom.,
				<i>plane figure</i> resembling the solid <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β.</span> in appearance, <i><span class="en">
				Papp.
				878
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> name of a
				<i>constellation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				8.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>base</i> of molar teeth, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.93
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
